---
// CONTENT §6, works with your stack. Premium grouped-relationship compatibility block: the
// integration story (built on / wallets via / for MUSD on / runs on / React hooks), each item a
// refined lockup. Real monochrome marks for the OSS libraries with a clean SVG (viem, wagmi,
// React, Node colorize to their brand color on hover); Mezo and Passport use a tasteful wordmark
// lockup (no sourced mark, and a wordmark keeps the unofficial framing without implying
// endorsement). Names carry the meaning, so the marks are decorative (aria-hidden).

// Inline marks, currentColor-driven so they sit monochrome and colorize on hover. React, Node and
// wagmi are the official CC0 simple-icons marks, unmodified, in a nominative "works with" context.
const wagmiPath =
